MOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 6cm cavity which encompasses the white particles and underlies the previously described defect  This cavity is 0 2cm from the superior margin  0 3cm from the inferior margin  0 5cm from the anterior margin  and 0 7cm from the posterior margin  0 7cm from the lateral margin  and 0 8cm from the medial margin  Leading into this cavity is a REMOVED_DATE x 0 2cm hemorrhagic tract  The clip identified in the accompanying specimen radiograph is not identified grossly  The specimen is entirely submitted  SECTION CODE   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Medial margin  radially   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   The specimen  from medial to lateral  with the area surrounding the cavity as  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID    REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Lateral margin  radially  Final Diagnosis by Kristina Braaten M D   Electronically signed on REMOVED_DATE PART   BREAST  LEFT   EXCISION  report_end  , Absent.
